*** Keywords ***
Start alarms watchdog
    [Documentation]  Starts watching alarms on BTS with default (common for any test suite) allowed alarms.
    ...              on_gnb and on_enb are boolean values that define whether watchdog on gNB and eNB (if exsists)
    ...              bts should be started.
    [Arguments]                                           ${interval}=2 sec
    ...                                                   ${gnb_bts_id}=0
    ...                                                   ${enb_bts_id}=0
    ...                                                   ${log_dir}=/tmp
    ...                                                   ${on_gnb}=${True}
    ...                                                   ${on_enb}=${True}
    Robot Log Operation                                   Starting alarms watchdog...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds          30 sec    5 sec  alarms_manager.start_alarms_watchdog
    ...                                                   interval=${interval}
    ...                                                   tl=${tl}
    ...                                                   log_dir=${log_dir}
    ...                                                   on_gnb=${on_gnb}
    ...                                                   on_enb=${on_enb}
    ...                                                   gnb_bts_id=${gnb_bts_id}
    ...                                                   enb_bts_id=${enb_bts_id}


Check alarms and stop watchdog
    [Documentation]  Checks whether alarms watchdog detected any disallowed alarms on BTS and stops watching alarms
    ...              afterwards. Arguments on_gnb and on_enb are boolean values that define whether check and stop
    ...              watchdog on gNB and eNB (if exsists) should be performed. If reset_allowed_alarms is set to True
    ...              then allowed alarms will be reset to default state before checking for detected alarms to be able
    ...              to catch any active alarm not allowed by default. If reset_allowed_alarms is set to False
    ...              then allowed alarms will stay unchanged - any alarm which was allowed prior to this keyword
    ...              usage will be still allowed during detected alarms check.
    [Arguments]      ${reset_allowed_alarms_gnb}=${True}
    ...              ${reset_allowed_alarms_enb}=${True}
    ...              ${on_gnb}=${True}
    ...              ${on_enb}=${True}
    Robot Log Operation                      Checking alarms and stopping watchdog
    alarms_manager.check_alarms_and_stop_watchdog
    ...                                      reset_allowed_alarms_gnb=${reset_allowed_alarms_gnb}
    ...                                      reset_allowed_alarms_enb=${reset_allowed_alarms_enb}
    ...                                      on_gnb=${on_gnb}
    ...                                      on_enb=${on_enb}


