Check If Second Log Collection Is Needed
    [Documentation]  Checking if particular alarm was detected and return boolean value to decide if
    ...              second log collection trigger is needed.
    [Arguments]      ${alarms_for_second_log_collection}
    ...              ${bts_type}=GNB

    Run keyword if   """${alarms_for_second_log_collection}"""=="""${None}"""
    ...                                             Return from keyword
    ...                                             ${False}

    FOR  ${alarm_name}  IN  @{alarms_for_second_log_collection}
        ${was_alarm_detected}=                      Alarms.Was alarm detected
        ...                                         fault_name=${alarm_name}
        ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
        Run keyword if                              """${was_alarm_detected}"""=="""True"""
        ...                                         Return From Keyword             ${True}
    END
    Return from keyword                             ${False}
